Bank logos vendored for the Financials app (feature colors-and-icons)
=====================================================================

Origin
  Repository: https://github.com/Tgentil/Bancos-em-SVG (branch main)
  Commit consulted: fe1d43f0cf379135bd01c987bc147a04fdf48c6d

Files copied (source path in the repository -> file in this folder)
  Nu Pagamentos S.A/nubank-logo-fundo-roxo2021.svg      -> nubank.svg
  Banco Sofisa/logo-sofisa.svg                          -> sofisa-direto.svg
  Neon/header-logo-neon.svg                             -> neon.svg
  XP Investimentos/xp-investimentos-logo.svg            -> xp.svg

License
  The source repository has no license file. The project owner confirmed that using these
  files is acceptable for the personal use of this project. The brands and logos belong to
  their respective banks.

Edits made to the files (nothing else was changed in the drawings)
  - All four: removed the XML declaration, comments and editor metadata (sodipodi, inkscape,
    rdf, cc and dc elements, attributes and namespace declarations).
  - neon.svg: viewBox changed from "0 0 2500 2500" to "0 988.26 2500 543.48" (the box of the
    mark, which is the clip rectangle of the original file) so the mark fills the frame.

Usage
  The files are imported by Vite and shown only through <img> (see BankIcon.tsx), never inlined.
  A test (banks.test.ts) checks size, viewBox and the absence of scripts and external
  references in every file of this folder.

Warning
  Any use beyond the personal use of this project (distribution, public deployment for other
  people, commercial use) requires reviewing the origin and the rights of these files first.
